      "panel-2": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "id": 2,
          "title": "Graph 节点延迟 P95 (5分钟窗口)",
          "description": "这是整个 dashboard 的灵魂面板. 一行 PromQL histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, node_name) (rate(...[5m]))) 做了 4 件事: rate 算每秒增长率、sum by (le, node_name) 按 bucket 边界和节点名聚合、histogram_quantile 算 95 分位. 这是 Prometheus 直方图 + PromQL 的精髓. 自研指标数据库要做到这个效果得写几百行 Java.",
          "links": [],
          "data": {
            "kind": "QueryGroup",
            "spec": {
